---
import resume from '../content/resume.json';
---

<section class="home-hero">
  <div>
    <h1>I'm Vinayak.</h1>
    <p class="hero-statement">Curious by default.<br />Useful by intention.</p>
    <p class="hero-role">Senior Software Engineer (MLOps) at SimCorp.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p>I learn by building, think by working through the problem, and care about what happens after the code is written.</p>
    <p>I enjoy the stretch between exploring something new and making it useful for a team. Sometimes that means building an AI tool; sometimes it means sitting with a teammate to find a path forward.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href={`mailto:${resume.basics.email}`}>Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
      <a class="text-link" href="/work">Explore my work &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
